  <note>
    <content textType="body" fontSize="12" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2">
      <p>This page reports the preregistered four-seed robustness analysis, not untouched confirmation.</p>
      <p>The all-feature model significantly beats GC-only ridge on both sequence-OOD endpoints, but only two of eight Holm-corrected tests pass.</p>
      <p>It does not significantly outperform full-proxy ridge or HistGB, and all-versus-none CB-MSE reverses for one seed.</p>
      <p>Therefore RK-G1 and generator authorization remain false; shared-GPU runtime is not a time-matched SOTA result.</p>
    </content>
